<p>Bano kehti hai khudaya kya karu<br />
aa raha hai yaad bacha kya karu</p>

<p>Chaand kis badli me mera chup gaya<br />
ho gaya hai hai andhera kya karu</p>

<p>Kaise neend aayegi jalti reth par<br />
meri godi hai na jhoola kya karu</p>

<p>Dil ke jo armaa'n the dil me reh gaye<br />
Ho gaya hai god soona kya karu</p>

<p>Ghutniyo'n chalte na dekha laal ko<br />
thi badi iski tamanna kya karu</p>

<p>Khoo'n bhari soorat teri nazro'n me hai<br />
muh ko aata hai kaleja kya karu</p>

<p>Aao asghar aao maa hai muntazar<br />
Tum bataao jee ke tanha kya karu</p>

<p>Saahibe aulaad batlaae'n zara<br />
mai jhula kar khaali jhoola kya karu<br />
</p>